  "citation": "HL7AUSD-STD-OO-ADRM-2021.1, section 7.2.1 Patient Referral Message Structure (REF_I12), pp 324 to 325. Caption erratum: the caption prints 'REF^I12^REF_I2'; the section title and section 7.3.1.9 (p 326: MSH-9 'must be valued as: REF^I12^REF_I12') give REF_I12. 'Australian localisation of the REF_I12 message structure is at variance from HL7 International V2.4 REF_I12 definition' (p 325). Constrains HL7 v2.4 Chapter 11, section 11.5.1, pp 11-16 to 11-17: RF1 and PV1 are required, both optional in the base; base segments the print omits are not findings (ADR-019 decision 7). The segments and groups it adds (IAM, and the pharmacy, problem, goal and pathway groups) are matched here only. Unprinted group names (ADR-019 decision 3): OBSERVATION (HL7-xml v2.4/REF_I12.xsd, REF_I12.OBSERVATION.CONTENT), the base group with the same head segment; ORC_GROUP (synthesised), RXO_GROUP (synthesised), RXE_GROUP (synthesised), RXD_GROUP (synthesised), RXA_GROUP (synthesised), PRB_GROUP (synthesised), ROL_GROUP (synthesised), GOL_GROUP (synthesised) and PTH_GROUP (synthesised), groups the base REF_I12 does not have.",
